{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>YHWH will fight for you.</b> On your behalf. And so every war [in which] the lamed after it is for aid — therefore R. Moses the Cohen explained רבים לוחמים לי מרום (Psalms 56:3) as 'on my behalf,' and the meaning of מרום is 'war from on high,' like the way of all who sit [above]." "<b>And you — keep silent.</b> The opposite of 'the children of Israel cried out.'"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:24.972139993Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}